Description: Audit logging module for Percona Valkey
 valkey-audit provides audit logging for Percona Valkey via the
 libvalkeyaudit.so loadable module. It logs connections, authentication,
 configuration changes, key operations and other commands to a file, syslog
 or a TCP endpoint, in text, JSON or CSV format, with exclusion rules by user,
 IP and command.
 .
 The module is installed into /usr/lib/valkey/modules. It is not loaded
 automatically; enable it with 'loadmodule' in valkey.conf or 'MODULE LOAD'.
